# Pit entry observation for inc-szz3, human paladin of Erich, seed 4.
# Terrain list observed in pit-probe: [U] pit, on page 1 (1-51 of 63).
# WHAT IT BUILDS on seed 4: arrival (17,80), pits at (18,80),
# (19,80), (20,80), (21,80). Coordinates read from player-position.
# Run with: tools/headless.sh tools/keys/pit-fall.keys 4
# The terrain menu paginates; [U] is on the first page, no TAB needed.
# SPACE follows the chargen arrival dismissal. The first w opens wizard
# mode; K selects Change terrain type, and the cursor starts on the player.
# Confirm entry only when asked. A prone move stands up in place; later
# moves attempt climbing. Dump every attempt and the complete message log.
@include chargen-paladin.keys
SPACE
w y
K RIGHT ENTER U
w K RIGHT*2 ENTER U
w K RIGHT*3 ENTER U
w K RIGHT*4 ENTER U
w a
@dump:player-position
ESC
@dump:before
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:after
RIGHT
@dump:stand-attempt
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:move-attempt-2
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:move-attempt-3
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:move-attempt-4
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:move-attempt-5
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@dump:move-attempt-6
v
@dump:messages
@quit
